[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6002.07, "timestamp": "01:40:02", "text": "上帝。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6004.47, "timestamp": "01:40:04", "text": "我的SMP里就是这样。哦，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6008.31, "timestamp": "01:40:08", "text": "上帝。我们一开始都像垂死挣扎一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6010.47, "timestamp": "01:40:10", "text": "就是最基本的僵尸，然后当我们……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6012.149, "timestamp": "01:40:12", "text": "我们的第一件武器，我们可以战斗"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6014.47, "timestamp": "01:40:14", "text": "他们回来后，又出现了一个四级僵尸。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6015.99, "timestamp": "01:40:15", "text": "会突然出现并杀死我们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6018.87, "timestamp": "01:40:18", "text": "哦不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6022.95, "timestamp": "01:40:22", "text": "很有趣。我不会撒谎。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6024.709, "timestamp": "01:40:24", "text": "我这是在自吹自擂。我就是那个人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6026.87, "timestamp": "01:40:26", "text": "正是它创建了SMP，而SMP又创建了mod"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6029.27, "timestamp": "01:40:29", "text": "盒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6032.07, "timestamp": "01:40:32", "text": "哦，是定制的那款。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6034.87, "timestamp": "01:40:34", "text": "是的。该死。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6036.79, "timestamp": "01:40:36", "text": "所以这意味着你很擅长编程，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6039.189, "timestamp": "01:40:39", "text": "东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6040.55, "timestamp": "01:40:40", "text": "是的。高中时，我曾经……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6042.91, "timestamp": "01:40:42", "text": "仔细研究一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6046.27, "timestamp": "01:40:46", "text": "哦，那真不错。真的吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6051.51, "timestamp": "01:40:51", "text": "是的。它叫做……嗯……我做了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6054.07, "timestamp": "01:40:54", "text": "可以去上一些相关的课程，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6055.99, "timestamp": "01:40:55", "text": "但我不知道。我找不到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6058.229, "timestamp": "01:40:58", "text": "继续前进的动力。我的意思是，它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6059.27, "timestamp": "01:40:59", "text": "并不是我找不到动力。"}]